# Output
.output
.vercel
.netlify
.wrangler
/.svelte-kit

# /build IS ignored, same as a normal SvelteKit project - the root
# .gitignore's own `/cmd/hush-hush/web/build/*` handles it. The one
# exception is `build/index.html`, kept as a static placeholder so a
# bare `go build`/`go test ./...`, with no frontend build step first,
# still compiles (`go:embed all:web/build` needs at least one matching
# file present) - see the root .gitignore's own comment and
# `cmd/hush-hush/embed.go` for the full reasoning. Never regenerate that
# placeholder by running `bun run build` and committing the result:
# Docker, goreleaser, and CI's own `e2e` job all build the real SPA
# fresh before anything actually serves it, so the placeholder's content
# is never read by any of them (alrayyes/hush-hush#470).

# The changelog and license pages' own source: copied fresh from the
# repo root by `bun run dev`/`build` (the "copy-changelog"/"copy-license"
# scripts) every time, so a committed copy here would just be a second
# one to drift out of sync.
/static/CHANGELOG.md
/static/LICENSE.txt

